                           					Degree Plan
                           					<span class="ml-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="fill-current gcsc-transition gcsc-cta-arrow flex-none">
